  "bodyHash": "cU5TmLALnx4=",
  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://ipn.anti-ad.org/assets/static/Inventory_Profiles_Next_Bg1line.png\" width=\"800px\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:center\"><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://discord.gg/23YCxmveUM\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/861171785897738240?style=plastic&amp;logo=discord&amp;label=discord&amp;link=https://discord.gg/23YCxmveUM\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/495267?style=plastic&amp;logo=curseforge\" alt=\"CurseForge 下載數\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/inventory-profiles-next?style=plastic&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;link=https://modrinth.com/mod/inventory-profiles-next\" alt=\"Modrinth 下載數\"> <a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://github.com/blackd/Inventory-Profiles\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/source-code-blue?style=plastic&amp;logo=github\" alt=\"靜態徽章\"></a></p>\n</div><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px\">此模組將會：</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\">幫助你保持物品欄整齊有序</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\">替換你快要壞掉的工具</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\">一鍵將所有物品放入儲物箱</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\">將你身上且儲物箱已有的物品移入其中</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\">鎖定物品欄位，使其在排序時被忽略</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\">保持已鎖定欄位為空</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\">允許你按 R+C 設定快捷鍵</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\">純客戶端模組，可在任何地方運作</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://discord.gg/23YCxmveUM\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我們的 Discord</a></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/blackd/Inventory-Profiles/all-in-one/description/output.webp\" width=\"300px\"></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px\">此模組<strong style=\"font-size:14px\">並非</strong>是 <strong style=\"font-size:14px\">Inventory Tweaks</strong> 的直接替代品</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\">無法讓 <strong style=\"font-size:14px\">Inventory Profiles Next</strong> 完全像 <strong style=\"font-size:14px\">Inventory Tweaks</strong> 一樣運作</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\">如果你從 <strong style=\"font-size:14px\">Inventory Tweaks</strong> 轉來，你需要學習如何使用 <strong style=\"font-size:14px\">Inventory Profiles Next</strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\">如果無法做到上述事項，你可以使用 <a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/invtweaks-emu-for-ipn\" rel=\"nofollow\">InvTweaks Emu for IPN</a> 來模擬部分「Inventory Tweaks」使用的快捷鍵。</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:bold\">喜歡這個模組嗎？考慮請我喝杯咖啡。</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-weight:bold\">成為 Patreon 贊助者</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"background-color:dimgray\"><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mirinimi\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://ipn.anti-ad.org/cgi-bin/test.png\" alt=\"Patreon 標誌\"> </a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-weight:bold\">成為 GitHub 贊助者</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n<td><span><iframe src=\"https://github.com/sponsors/blackd/button\" height=\"35\" width=\"142\"></iframe></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-weight:bold\">使用教學</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><div style=\"width:100%\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/cv7_vW-GIJU?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></div><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-weight:bold\">依賴項目</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"font-weight:bold\">Fabric</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a></li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-language-kotlin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric Language Kotlin</a></li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/libipn\" rel=\"nofollow\">libIPN</a></li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"font-weight:bold\">Forge</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kotlin-for-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kotlin For Forge</a></li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/libipn\" rel=\"nofollow\">libIPN</a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-weight:bold\">警告</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"font-size:14px\">由於多個 Quilt 專屬崩潰及一項物品複製問題，Quilt 支援目前定義如下：</p><pre><code>此模組將透過提供的 Fabric 相容性在 Quilt 上運作。\n任何無法在 Fabric 上重現的問題，將以非常低的優先級處理。</code></pre><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-weight:bold\">貢獻</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"font-size:14px\">如果某個功能無法正常運作，請在<a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://github.com/blackd/Inventory-Profiles/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>提交問題</p><p style=\"font-size:14px\">如果你使用其他語言，並希望協助翻譯，可以<a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://github.com/blackd/Inventory-Profiles/tree/all-in-one/common/src/main/resources/assets/inventoryprofilesnext/lang\" rel=\"nofollow\">在此</a>進行</p><p style=\"font-size:14px\">如果你是 Kotlin 開發者，並希望貢獻程式碼，請參閱<a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://github.com/blackd/Inventory-Profiles\" rel=\"nofollow\">原始碼</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-weight:bold\">授權許可</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"font-size:14px\">此模組以 <a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://github.com/blackd/Inventory-Profiles/blob/all-in-one/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\">AGPL v3 授權</a> 發布</p><p style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</p>",
